      "Arc is EVM compatible, so Ethereum-style wallets and contracts work on it, and Uniswap v4 is deployed there.",
      "Its stated purpose is payments and stablecoin finance, not meme coins, but any cheap EVM chain with a DEX attracts them; see [meme coins on Arc](/learn/arc-network-meme-coins/).",
